 "kind": "buffer",
 "model": "tristate",
 "function": "Buffer",
 "description": "Octal buffer/line driver, 3-state outputs",
 "drawer": [
  "Logic"
 ],
 "note": "p20 from sn74hc244 p.3, sn74lvc244a p.3-4 (DB/DGV/DW/N/NS/PW/RGY/DGS/RKS: same numbers 1-20, VQFN thermal pad is not a pin), sn74ls244 p.3 (J/W/DB/DW/N/NS and FK: same numbers), sn74f244 p.1 and sn54abt244 p.1 (FK same numbers), cy74fct244t p.1 (P/Q/SO/D and L LCC same numbers). Pin names normalized to the SN74 names: SN74LS/S244 print 1G/2G for 1OE/2OE (sn74ls244 p.3); CD74HC/HCT/AC/ACT244 number bits from 0 (1A0..1A3 = 1A1..1A4, 1Y0..1Y3 = 1Y1..1Y4, 2A0..2A3 = 2A1..2A4, 2Y0..2Y3 = 2Y1..2Y4, same pins; cd74hc244 p.3, cd74ac244 p.4); CY54/74FCT244T print OEA/OEB, DA0-3/OA0-3, DB0-3/OB0-3 (OEA=1OE, DAn=1A(n+1), OAn=1Y(n+1), OEB=2OE, DB0..DB3 at pins 17,15,13,11 = 2A4..2A1, OB0..OB3 at pins 3,5,7,9 = 2Y4..2Y1; cy74fct244t p.1, p.3). Function table: OE L -> Y = A, OE H -> Z (cd74fct244 p.1, cy74fct244t p.2).",
